{"id":"vod_bf_27834","vodId":"27834","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"犬神","name_cn":"犬神","date":"2006-01-01","year":"2006","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-29/9e91f20bab9cd4ade18ddffed99518e1.jpg"},"summary":"虽然出身于历史上最著名的犬神使家族，但川平启太（福山润 配音）似乎并没有继承祖先接触的御神能力，甚至因为能力平庸而被逐出了家门。所以，当犬神阳子（堀江由衣 配音）出现在他的面前，并且愿意和他签下契约的时候，启太想也没想就同意了。没想到，阳子是犬神中的另类分子，异常暴躁又容易暴走的性格和启太的不学无术和自暴自弃倒是十分的匹配。　　作为启太的表哥，川平薫（甲斐田幸 配音）有着无人可能超越的，同时御有十位犬神的传奇人物，但看似声名显赫的薰的内心里却还有着不能说出的秘密。启太和薰的相遇，阳子和薰那十位美艳娇俏的犬神的相遇，会迸发出怎样有趣惊险的故事呢？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 05:28:42","playable":true,"episodeCount":29,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"HD国语","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/quanshen/HD国语/index.m3u8"},{"name":"HD粤语","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/quanshen/HD粤语/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/quanshen/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/quanshen/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/quanshen/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/quanshen/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/quanshen/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/quanshen/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf5.com/video/quanshen/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/quanshen/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/quanshen/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/quanshen/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/quanshen/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/quanshen/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/quanshen/第13集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url